+    // Card-stats audit (patch 0003): the full CardStats behind a card id.
+    // {"base": stats, "evolved": stats | None, "evolution_cycle_threshold",
+    //  "evolved_uses", "units": {...}}. Units: ticks (10/s), tiles; speeds in
